## Remote services accessed at runtime (no code linked into OpenTodo)

The following remote APIs are called over HTTPS but are not statically or
dynamically linked into OpenTodo. They are listed here for transparency and
are governed by their respective terms of service, not by code licenses.

  - Google Drive REST API — used by the sync engine when the user opts in to
    Google Drive synchronisation. Subject to Google API Services User Data
    Policy. See `src/sync/drive_api.cpp`, `src/sync/oauth_client.cpp`.

  - Anthropic Messages API (Claude) — used by the optional AI assistant for
    subtask generation. Subject to Anthropic's Usage Policy and the user's
    own API key. See `src/services/aiassistant.cpp`.


